                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When your truck is your livelihood, every hour it spends off the road matters. Whether you operate a single truck or manage an entire fleet, choosing the right International truck service center can make a significant difference in your uptime, operating costs, and overall peace of mind.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we know your priorities are simple: quality repairs, honest communication, and getting back on the road as quickly as possible. That's why our service teams focus on keeping commercial vehicles operating safely and efficiently, backed by factory-trained technicians and genuine parts. This customer-first approach reflects Sun State International's mission of providing quality transportation products, parts, and services while building lasting relationships through dependable service.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-it-matters",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Choosing the Right International Truck Service Center Matters",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-it-matters"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-it-matters-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A commercial truck experiences far more wear and tear than the average passenger vehicle. From heavy loads and long highway miles to Florida's heat and unpredictable weather, every component is under constant stress. Vehicle maintenance and repair remain one of the largest operating expenses for trucking companies, making preventive service one of the smartest investments a fleet can make. An experienced International truck service center doesn't simply fix problems; it helps prevent them before they become expensive breakdowns.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-why-it-matters-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "schedule-service",
                        "label": "Schedule Service at Sun State International"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-factory-trained",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Factory-Trained Technicians Who Know International Trucks",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "factory-trained"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-factory-trained-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every repair shop has the expertise to properly diagnose today's commercial trucks. An experienced International truck dealer service department works specifically with International trucks every day. Factory-trained technicians understand the latest engines, electrical systems, emissions technology, diagnostics, and manufacturer repair procedures.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-factory-trained-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That specialized knowledge means:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-factory-trained-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Faster diagnostics"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "More accurate repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fewer repeat visits"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Less unexpected downtime"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-factory-trained-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Instead of guessing at the problem, experienced technicians can quickly identify the root cause and recommend the right repair the first time.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/what-to-expect-from-an-international-truck-service-center/1.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International technician working at a toolbox in the service bay"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-genuine-parts",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Genuine Parts Make a Difference",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "genuine-parts"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-genuine-parts-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Quality repairs depend on quality parts. One advantage of working with an International truck dealer service department is immediate access to genuine OEM parts designed specifically for your truck.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-genuine-parts-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Using the correct components helps maintain:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-genuine-parts-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Performance"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reliability"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Safety"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Manufacturer specifications"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-genuine-parts-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Need Parts Fast?",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "need-parts-fast"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-genuine-parts-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you're handling routine maintenance or replacing a worn component, Sun State International's online parts store makes ordering genuine truck parts simple and convenient. You can quickly find the parts you need and get your truck back to work faster. Visit our Online Parts Store to order genuine International truck parts today.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-genuine-parts-6-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-genuine-parts-6",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
