                      "alt": "Sun State International parts team pulling genuine truck parts from warehouse shelving"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-comprehensive-service",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Comprehensive Commercial Truck Service",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "comprehensive-service"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-comprehensive-service-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A trusted commercial truck service near me should be able to handle more than oil changes. At Sun State International, our service departments are equipped to perform a wide range of maintenance and repairs for all makes and models, including:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-comprehensive-service-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Preventive maintenance"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "DOT inspections"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Suspension service"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Cooling system repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Electrical diagnostics"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Engine diagnostics"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Transmission repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Air conditioning repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Warranty repairs"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-comprehensive-service-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Having sales, parts, and service all under one roof helps simplify your maintenance experience and reduces the time spent coordinating repairs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-communication",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Communication You Can Count On",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "communication"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-communication-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One of the biggest frustrations for fleet managers isn't just unexpected repairs; it's not knowing what's happening. At Sun State International, clear communication is part of every service visit. Our team keeps customers informed throughout the repair process, explains recommended services, and works to minimize downtime whenever possible. That straightforward approach is part of what has helped Sun State International earn long-term relationships with customers across Florida.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-3",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/what-to-expect-from-an-international-truck-service-center/3.jpg",
                      "width": 1280,
                      "height": 853,
                      "alt": "Sun State International service team communicating with a customer at the front desk"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-long-term-partner",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "More Than Repairs, A Long-Term Service Partner",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "long-term-partner"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-long-term-partner-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The best International truck service center isn't just there when something breaks. It becomes a long-term partner that helps you plan maintenance schedules, reduce unexpected failures, and keep your fleet operating efficiently throughout the year. For owner-operators, every day on the road matters. For fleet managers, every truck in service contributes to profitability. Working with a trusted service partner helps protect both.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Trucks Moving With Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Finding the right commercial truck service near me means choosing a team that understands your business, values your time, and delivers dependable repairs you can trust. At Sun State International, we're committed to helping owner-operators and fleets stay productive with expert technicians, genuine parts, and responsive customer service. Whether you need routine maintenance or heavy-duty truck repair in Florida, our team is ready to help. Ready to minimize downtime? <a href=\"/service-appointment\">Schedule your next service appointment with Sun State International today</a> and let our experienced technicians keep your trucks performing at their best.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
